  "storyboard": {
    "offer": "At home Ana invites Luis to watch TV. In a separate park encounter, Sofía invites the tired Luis to play football. These are explicitly different moments.",
    "accept": "Luis visibly accepts Ana’s TV invitation and joins her. Show the exchange first, then the resulting shared activity.",
    "decline": "At the park Luis politely declines Sofía’s invitation to play because he is tired. Listen supplies the refusal; a generic pointing picture cannot prove it.",
    "alternative": "Sofía suggests music, Luis agrees and they share it. A clearly marked later plan introduces reading on Saturday and dancing on Sunday; a separate photo invitation retrieves Ana’s stated interest from 7.6."
